Date:   Tue Nov 3 19:06:45 2026 +0530

    Reject an asOf after today, and pin the empty-asOf 400
    
    An asOf in the future (up to +999999999-12-31 parses) made the age loop run
    day by day across centuries and filled the missing-holiday-file warning set.
    Per the approver's decision on review finding R-1, an asOf after today in the
    server's zone is now a caller error: 400 with a message, a new FR8 case.
    Tests cover tomorrow and the far-future date. R-2: a test pins that an empty
    asOf= returns 400.
